         "label": "Product Banner Module",
         "name": "widget_1734071178287",
         "params": {
          "add_content": "<h1>Unified inventory planning and decision making for <span>ecommerce + wholesale</span></h1>\n<p>Omnichannel brands that sell on DTC and wholesale channels must manage completely separate inventory planning processes for each\u2014creating two siloed areas and frequent planning breakdowns. Flieber enables brands to make decisions that support the combined needs of all channels by consolidating data from every channel, inventory system, and fulfillment partner into a clean, unified view.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Reduce stockouts, free up your capital, and gain more confidence in your forecasting.</p>",
