      "rows": [
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two Col Row Module",
         "name": "widget_1747375361325",
         "params": {
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "image_content_group": [
           {
            "add_image": {
             "alt": "logistic-1-1",
             "height": 373,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "exact",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/logistic-1-1.png",
             "width": 500
            },
            "description": "DTC vs. wholesale channel sales behavior is drastically different, which makes planning for both at the same time challenging. You end up with two siloes, causing unbalanced operations and channel competition that frustrates customers.",
            "heading": "Multi-channel logistics"
           },
           {
            "add_image": {
             "alt": "overstock",
             "height": 348,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "exact",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/overstock.png",
             "width": 550
            },
            "description": "Your systems don\u2019t talk to each other, so you end up ordering too much stock \u201cjust to be safe\u201d and can\u2019t make fast decisions during spikes and lulls. Worse, you sometimes end up making decisions based on bad data.\u00a0",
            "heading": "Overstock and slow decision-making"
           },
           {
            "add_image": {
             "alt": "manual-entry-1-1",
             "height": 324,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "exact",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/manual-entry-1-1.png",
             "width": 500
            },
            "description": "Flieber is a powerful and customizable tool with native integration for the most relevant marketplaces. ",
            "heading": "Fragmented data and manual entry"
           },
           {
            "add_image": {
             "alt": "forcasting-1",
             "height": 315,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "exact",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/forcasting-1.png",
             "width": 550
            },
            "description": "Understanding demand across DTC, marketplaces, and wholesale is a complex struggle. Each channel has different sales behaviors and replenishment timelines.\u00a0",
            "heading": "Complex demand forecasting"
           }
          ],
          "module_id": 190169509042,
          "schema_version": 2,
          "style": {
           "section_background_color": {
            "color": "#fff",
            "opacity": 100
           }
          },
          "sub_title_text": "As omnichannel specialists who understand your unique headaches, we built Flieber to help you overcome real problems and complexities. If you\u2019re suffering from one or all of the following issues, Flieber can help.\u00a0",
          "title_text": "We understand the challenges <span>omnichannel</span> brands face."
         },
