         "label": "Case Module V1",
         "name": "widget_1747374351908",
         "params": {
          "bg_color": {
           "color": "#333333",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "left_case_list_group": [
           {
            "icon_image": {
             "alt": "ai-powered",
             "height": 40,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 40,
             "max_width": 41,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/ai-powered.svg",
             "width": 41
            },
            "sub_text": "Accurate, channel-specific sales forecasts that consider the unique factors of DTC, marketplaces, and wholesale.",
            "title_text": "AI-powered forecasting by channel and SKU"
           },
           {
            "icon_image": {
             "alt": "inventory",
             "height": 40,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 40,
             "max_width": 41,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/inventory.svg",
             "width": 41
            },
            "sub_text": "Visual, omnichannel inventory forecasts showing future stockouts, PO/TO arrivals, and consumption across all locations and SKUs.",
            "title_text": "Inventory visualizations and insights"
           },
           {
            "icon_image": {
             "alt": "smart-recommandation",
             "height": 36,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 36,
             "max_width": 51,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/smart-recommandation.svg",
             "width": 51
            },
            "sub_text": "Tailored recommendations for reordering or transferring inventory by location or sales channel to ensure you maximize efficiency and don\u2019t tie up capital in overstock.",
            "title_text": "Smart replenishment recommendations"
           },
           {
            "icon_image": {
             "alt": "scenario",
             "height": 45,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 45,
             "max_width": 46,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/scenario.svg",
             "width": 46
            },
            "sub_text": "Simulate promotions, shipping changes, or other strategies to make confident decisions before committing to new ways of doing business.",
            "title_text": "Scenario testing for confident decision-making"
           },
           {
            "icon_image": {
             "alt": "ERP",
             "height": 40,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 40,
             "max_width": 41,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/ERP.svg",
             "width": 41
            },
            "sub_text": "Flieber can integrate with ERPs like NetSuite without any changes to the ERP. You don\u2019t need an ERP to run Flieber, but if you do, it sits alongside it and makes it smarter.\u00a0",
            "title_text": "No ERP overhaul required"
           },
           {
            "icon_image": {
             "alt": "integrate",
             "height": 40,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 40,
             "max_width": 41,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Flieber/images/Omnichannel/integrate.svg",
             "width": 41
            },
            "sub_text": "Flieber has pre-built integrations with the most common sales channels, inventory systems, shipping solutions, and ERPs. However, AI-based mapping makes it easy to integrate with less common systems\u2014and it even integrates with your spreadsheets.\u00a0",
            "title_text": "Easily integrate everything you need"
           }
          ],
